   "text": "INTO University of East Anglia - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nINTO University of East Anglia\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nINTO University of East Anglia (INTO UEA) is designed for student success. Our pathways are taught in a unique live-learn environment on a safe university campus, with progression to the University of East Anglia (UEA). Our students thrive at university and beyond with our tailored support. World top 200 university (Times Higher Education World University Rankings 2011–22).Over 79% of our students achieve a 1st or 2:1 (based on INTO UEA undergraduate students graduating in 2021).Located in Norwich – one of the best places to live in the UK (The Sunday Times ‘Best Places to Live’ 2021).96% of students feel safe and secure living at INTO UEA (INTO Annual Student Experience Survey 2022).95% student satisfaction with support; 94% student satisfaction with the learning experience (INTO Annual Student Experience Survey 2022).At INTO UEA, students can also take A levels through the INTO Newton A level Programme.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 09:57\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 09:57\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £17,850.00\nMin: £13,250.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n14%\n4,060 of 29,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nINTO\nFounded Year\n1963\nCampus(es)\nNorwich\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n17/01/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAs accommodation is allocated on a first-come, first-served basis, students should confirm their place soon after receiving an offer to have the best chance of getting their preferred option.\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FTQ0wAVXfXY\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
